msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫What’s the matter?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫You "
"lost, or you just tryin’ to take in the sights?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Qual é o problema?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Você "
"se perdeu, ou está apenas tentando aproveitar a vista?"

#: search:search_703E19E0_726C_433E_BAC7_50B93A16C2B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b966ba4f3cc1aaa14d84c4739556156e80db52c487d66e9157c621763c61556f
