msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Caught off-guard, ⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫he⟪k:4⟫ spun around, confused, in search of the source."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pego de surpresa, ⟪k:2⟫Você⟪k:3⟫ele⟪k:4⟫ girou, confuso, em busca da fonte."

#: search:search_30150091_426D_424D_BA43_80800C085731
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cce43f8440219c47b7d2dd239964f4f58832eb0f72d3631702d3fa6912a08aa
