msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A voz vinha de dentro da pintura."

#: search:search_D919F848_50E7_4423_9AA1_62B2AEE0FA02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00e7580ea50aac6895aee874f214d533d1c18cc1bd0685eee88a087ad3ed34bb
