msgctxt "search:search_D919F848_50E7_4423_9AA1_62B2AEE0FA02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ had passed by this wall on ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ way to "
"the third door,⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫ ⟪k:10⟫a magnificent landscape painting had been hanging there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando ⟪k:1⟫Você⟪k:2⟫o Falecido⟪k:3⟫ passou por esta parede no⟪k:4⟫ ⟪k:5⟫ seu ⟪k:6⟫caminho "
"para a terceira porta,⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫ ⟪k:10⟫uma magnífica pintura de paisagem estava pendurada lá."

#: search:search_C4E222F0_ECAB_4708_90BE_7BC639B4E253
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1bdd3f8f09ba1b4ee8d9c555111f16c4fd581250791ae10a041f06532f33c76
#. default-sha256: d479cbc9a46a9ebaf57abeea8bd2adf6d5ee616e20bd657397b58428c2571855
msgctxt "search:search_C4E222F0_ECAB_4708_90BE_7BC639B4E253"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But now, the canvas was a deep shade of black, as if it had been dipped into a vat of ink."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas agora, a tela tinha um tom profundo de preto, como se tivesse sido mergulhada em um "
"tonel de tinta."

#: search:search_E274FD87_12D4_4405_8215_FA3F45F727AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cecdd29da471d5e258c7eb6c0a804bbe28047d7a54b72b2fe066d04974ad93e2
#. default-sha256: 1999e699712dc8e8bdc7e6f420e29142c1b79631de06e473fde2d67dd6755552
msgctxt "search:search_E274FD87_12D4_4405_8215_FA3F45F727AD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Been a while since I’ve talked to anyone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫So tell me, you can hear me all right, "
"can’tcha?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Faz um tempo que não falo com ninguém.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Então me diga, você pode me ouvir bem, não "
"pode?"

#: search:search_3A7FA097_8099_4B4C_90DB_0DE1D276157B
